andrew_w: Heads-up — HashBridge onboarding pre-launch rehearsal tomorrow 10am PT. Need SSO (SAML) + SCIM mapping + HSM/KMS attestation checks. Can we align checklist?#newline#newlinemai_chen: I'll own SCIM mapping and provisioning tests. I'll need HashBridge schema + example users.#newline#newlinesam_hashbridge: Thanks — sending schema in DM now. For HSM, our device provides PKCS#11 endpoints; we have attestation report generator. @elena_ps can we validate cert chain?#newline#newlineelena_ps: Yep. I'll run attestation script and verify key wrap/unlock. Share sample attestation blob.#newline#newlineandrew_w: Great. High-level plan: (1) exchange SAML metadata (2) SCIM user sync smoke (3) KMS/HSM keywrap test (4) marketplace listing preflight & embargo timing. Anyone object?#newline#newlineproduct_marketing: We'll need final PR draft + joint blog outline by Wed EOD. Embargo lift target: Fri 9am PT. Does that align with ops?#newline#newlineelena_ps: Ops can do canary rollout Thu 2pm PT to dedicated cluster, fallback to hosted model if issue.#newline#newlinedeploy-bot: reminder: runway check — sandbox capacity scheduled 09:30 PT Thu#newline#newlineandrew_w: For SAML metadata exchange: please post metadata URLs. HashBridge, can you host metadata at a stable URL and support org-wide attributes? Example mapping below.#newline#newlinesam_hashbridge: metadata: https://hashbridge.example.com/saml/metadata.xml#newline#newlinemai_chen: SCIM attribute mapping (proposed):#newline#newline````
{
  "userName": "username",
  "name": {
    "givenName": "first_name",
    "familyName": "last_name"
  },
  "emails": ["email"]
}
````#newline#newlineandrew_w: KMS test command (non-prod):#newline#newline````
# wrap / unwrap
curl -X POST https://rwinf-kms.test/wrap -d '{"key":"test"}' -H 'Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN'
````#newline#newlineelena_ps: For HSM attestation, send the quote blob to /attest endpoint. I'll validate via our root CA.#newline#newlinesam_hashbridge: Sending attestation now (DM + posted to Confluence). Also attaching SHA256 of firmware: abc123def456... :lock:#newline#newlineproduct_marketing: Timeline confirmed. We need a 1-paragraph co-authored announcement + logo SVG by Thu morning.#newline#newlinemai_chen: Quick question: SCIM bulk user create — do we have rate limits in sandbox? I don't want to trigger quota.#newline#newlineandrew_w: Sandbox rate limit is 50 req/s for SCIM. Plan to batch in groups of 100 users with 2s pause. Also enable prefix caching for provisioning calls.#newline#newlineelena_ps: I'll prepare runbook steps for rollback: revoke federation, disable SCIM provisioning, rotate keys.#newline#newlinesam_hashbridge: Can we schedule a 30m dry-run Tue 4pm PT? We'll walk through metadata swap, single-user sync, and a keywrap/unwrap.#newline#newlineandrew_w: Yes — Tue 4pm works. I'll create a calendar invite and include runbook link. Bring laptop + VPN.#newline#newlineproduct_marketing: Also confirm embargo windows with legal. I'll ping legal and update thread.#newline#newlinemai_chen: I'll post SCIM test data and a small script in the runbook repo before Tue.#newline#newlineandrew_w: Perfect. Action items:#newline#newline- sam_hashbridge: host metadata + send attestation blob (done)#newline#newline- mai_chen: create SCIM test payload & script#newline#newline- elena_ps: attestation + KMS keywrap verification#newline#newline- product_marketing: finalize copy + logos, confirm legal embargo#newline#newline- andrew_w: calendar invite + runbook update#newline#newlineandrew_w: Anything else? Otherwise I'll lock this thread and move to calendar.#newline#newlinesam_hashbridge: Nothing from HashBridge. :thumbsup:#newline#newlineelena_ps: All good from infra side.#newline#newlinemai_chen: all set.#newline#newlineandrew_w: Thanks everyone. See you Tue 4pm PT.
